OL,3,ABurnham says climate consensus 'broken'
OL,4,Aand pledges 'new era of British
OL,5,Aleadership' in COP31 speech
OL,6,
OL,7,FAndy Burnham has been speaking at the
OL,8,FCOP31 climate conference in Antalya,
OL,9,FTurkey, on the fourth day of the annual
OL,10,FUN summit
OL,12,FThe UK prime minister pledged a "new
OL,13,Fera of British leadership" on climate
OL,14,Fand said the "consensus we once
OL,15,Fenjoyed" on the issue had "broken down"
OL,17,FBurnham, the only G7 leader to attend
OL,18,Fthis year's summit, also said the
OL,19,Fgovernment was committed to its 2050
OL,20,Fnet zero target and announced
OL,21,Fappointment of a new climate security
OL,22,Fenvoy, Dame Madeleine Alessandri,
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,0,100
