OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ABurnham says climate consensus 'broken'
OL,4,Aand pledges 'new era of British
OL,5,Aleadership' in COP31 speech
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt comes after the PM was pressed by
OL,8,FTory leader Kemi Badenoch in Parliament
OL,9,Fon Wednesday about whether the Rosebank
OL,10,Foil field would be allowed to proceed
OL,12,FIn October the government
OL,13,Fcontroversially approved drilling in
OL,14,Fthe Jackdaw gas field in the North Sea
OL,16,FThe world is currently on track for
OL,17,F2.8C of warming above pre-industrial
OL,18,Flevels by the end of the century - and
OL,19,Fis all but guaranteed to exceed the
OL,20,F2015 Paris Agreement goal of trying to
OL,21,Flimit the increase to 1.5C
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
